## How to use it

Every open question carries a recommendation, which is what gets built unless the Answer says otherwise.
Status is one of `OPEN` · `ANSWERED` · `SUPERSEDED`. An answered question moves to
[`archive/questions-resolved.md`](archive/questions-resolved.md), leaving one line under *Resolved*.

